# Mabel, Heir to Cragflame's Cragflame: "Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has vigilance, trample, and haste" and equip {2} (CR 301.5, 702.6,
# 613.4c, 702.10, 702.19, 702.20). Bot1 casts Mabel on turn 1 ({1}{R}{W}). On turn 3 it casts Memnite, a 1/1 that would be summoning sick,
# and pays equip {2} with two Moxen: the Memnite becomes 2/2 and can attack at once (haste). Bot2's Scurryfoot blocks it, and trample
# assigns 1 damage to the 1/1 blocker and the other 1 to Bot2 (19), and vigilance leaves the Memnite untapped. Memnite is no Mouse, so Mabel's
# +1/+1 is not what makes it 2/2. On turn 5 a second equip, onto Mabel, moves Cragflame (CR 702.6c): Memnite is a 1/1 again (it took no damage that turn) and Mabel a 4/4.

